# SASSLIGHT Style Guide

Always import and use tokens from `src/lib/brand.ts` for colors, buttons, inputs, surfaces, and layout.

## Brand Rules
- **Palette:** black backgrounds, gold/amber accents (`amber-400`–`amber-600`), zinc text
- **Never use:** emerald/green accents on this project
- **Logo:** use `<NavBrand />` component — do not recreate logo markup
- **Buttons:** use `brand.button.primary` / `brand.button.secondary`
- **Inputs:** use `brand.input` and `brand.label`
- **Cards:** use `brand.surfaces.card` or `brand.surfaces.cardHighlight`
- **Page layout:** use `brand.layout.container` or `brand.layout.pageNarrow`
- **Nav:** header uses `brand.surfaces.header` + `NavBrand size="nav"`

## New Components
- One component per file, function declaration for components
- Match existing spacing: `rounded-2xl`, `rounded-lg`, `px-4 sm:px-6`
- Affiliate links: `rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored"`

## Cloudflare
- Products stored in `PRODUCTS_KV` binding (production deploy)
- Admin secrets via `wrangler secret put` — never commit passwords
- Deploy with `npm run deploy`
